                <pb facs="0806" n="678" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg678"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Translation<anchor n="52"
                            xml:id="d440-f1"/>]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Argentine Proposals of December 1927, as Published in
                        “La Prensa” of July 13, 1928</hi></head>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>That Paraguay agree to proceed directly to arbitrate the fundamental
                        question.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>That Bolivia and Paraguay proceed to demilitarize all their fortins or to
                        withdraw those that are opposite each other to a distance of fifty
                        kilometers each; this act to be verified by a military commission from a
                        third country.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>That it be declared that the advances which either country may have made
                        have created a <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> situation which does
                        not give them any right nor can said advances be alleged before the
                        arbitrator as the basis of their claims.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
